/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682210/extras/180d9915633b956454b1a4804b987b81.mp4?t=1724188785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>Unique twist on the infamous Russian roulette where you have to play in order to gain the limited resources which will help you survive, the riskier you play the bigger your rewards will be.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682210/extras/acfb0224707165b2f2d8eafa2b2a1aff.poster.avif?t=1724188785\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682210/extras/acfb0224707165b2f2d8eafa2b2a1aff.webm?t=1724188785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682210/extras/acfb0224707165b2f2d8eafa2b2a1aff.mp4?t=1724188785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Time Manipulation</h2>On your way out you will face a difficult gauntlet of traps and various enemies, in addition to your gun you also have the ability to rewind and slow down time.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682210/extras/rewind.gif?t=1724188785\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682210/extras/d092e31b8a5187085234edcb784e9f2c.poster.avif?t=1724188785\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682210/extras/d092e31b8a5187085234edcb784e9f2c.webm?t=1724188785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682210/extras/d092e31b8a5187085234edcb784